<title>AUSTRIA: OPEC's Lukman says unlikely OPEC meeting ends today.</title>
<headline>OPEC's Lukman says unlikely OPEC meeting ends today.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>OPEC Secretary-General Rilwanu Lukman told reporters on Wednesday that he thought it unlikely that the group's meeting, scheduled to start at 1400 gmt, would end today.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
</text>
